# Pairs with SagaFallbackOnlyAcrossFull. A committed batch whose shard
# terminals are still to come is settled at once, so a terminal that lands after
# the drain is met by a later increment that no longer holds the batch's
# prepares, which then falls back.
MODULE: SagaFallbackOnlyAcrossFullTerminalsNotAwaited
TARGET: SagaFallbackOnlyAcrossFull
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a committed batch is settled before every shard terminal is read

--- FIND
       \/ d0 = "committed" /\ Complete /\ ~TermsComplete
--- REPLACE
       \* MUTATION: shard terminals are not awaited.
       \/ FALSE
--- END
